@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Landsat Mission Fleet | Briefing";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Filter, inspect, and compare Landsat missions.";
    ViewData["OgTitle"] = "Landsat Mission Fleet";
    ViewData["OgDescription"] = "Explore Landsat mission continuity, spacecraft generations, and sensor evolution.";
    ViewData["OgImage"] = "/img/landsat8photo.jpg";
    ViewData["BodyClass"] = "page-briefing";
    ViewData["BrandHref"] = "/briefing";
    ViewData["BrandSubtitle"] = "Briefing chapters";
    ViewData["NavLinks"] = new[]
    {
        new NavigationLink("Chapters", "/briefing"),
        new NavigationLink("Overview", "/briefing/overview"),
        new NavigationLink("Foundations", "/briefing/foundations"),
        new NavigationLink("Fleet", "/briefing/missions"),
        new NavigationLink("Applications", "/briefing/applications"),
        new NavigationLink("Products", "/briefing/products"),
        new NavigationLink("Studio", "/studio")
    };
}

<main class="shell container-xxl px-3 px-lg-4">
    <section id="missions" class="page-intro">
        <div class="section-heading row g-3 align-items-end">
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <div class="eyebrow">Mission Explorer</div>
                <h1>Move through the fleet, not just the timeline</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5">
                <p class="body-copy">
                    Filter by era or status, search by mission or sensor, and compare what changed from one spacecraft
                    generation to the next.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4 explorer-layout">
            <div class="col-xl-7">
                <div class="panel h-100">
                    <div class="row g-3 toolbar">
                        <div class="col-md-7">
                            <input class="input form-control" id="mission-search" type="search" placeholder="Search by mission, sensor, or keyword">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-5">
                            <select class="select form-select" id="mission-sort" aria-label="Sort missions">
                                <option value="asc">Sort: earliest first</option>
                                <option value="desc">Sort: latest first</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chip-row" id="filter-row" aria-label="Mission filters"></div>
                    <div class="mission-grid" id="mission-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xl-5">
                <aside class="panel mission-hero h-100" id="mission-detail" aria-live="polite">
                    <img class="mission-image" id="detail-image" src="/img/landsat9.jpg" alt="Landsat mission image">
                    <div>
                        <div class="eyebrow" id="detail-eyebrow">Selected Mission</div>
                        <h2 id="detail-title">Landsat 9</h2>
                        <p class="body-copy" id="detail-summary"></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="detail-grid" id="detail-grid"></div>
                    <div class="mission-detail-copy">
                        <p id="detail-highlight"></p>
                    </div>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel compare-panel mt-4">
            <div class="compare-header">
                <div>
                    <div class="eyebrow">Mission Compare</div>
                    <h3>Put missions side by side</h3>
                    <p class="body-copy">Compare up to three missions across status, launch date, sensors, revisit cadence, resolution, and why each mission mattered.</p>
                </div>
                <button class="chip-button compare-clear" id="compare-clear" type="button">Clear compare</button>
            </div>
            <div class="compare-selection" id="compare-selection" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <div class="compare-grid" id="compare-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="lesson-band mt-4">
            <article class="lesson-card">
                <div class="eyebrow">Sensor Evolution</div>
                <h3>What changed across the fleet?</h3>
                <p class="body-copy">The program moved from early MSS observations to Thematic Mapper, ETM+, and the OLI/TIRS era. Each shift improved the way students can study land cover, thermal behavior, radiometry, and continuity.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="lesson-card">
                <div class="eyebrow">Continuity Lesson</div>
                <h3>Why Landsat 7 still matters</h3>
                <p class="body-copy">Landsat 7 is decommissioned as of June 4, 2025, but its archive still anchors studies from 1999 through the open-data era. The scan line corrector anomaly is also a useful QA lesson: know the instrument history before trusting pixels blindly.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="lesson-card">
                <div class="eyebrow">Policy Turning Point</div>
                <h3>2008: the archive became free and open</h3>
                <p class="body-copy">In 2008, USGS lifted the cost barrier and made the entire Landsat archive free to download. Usage and downstream scientific output grew sharply afterward, and that same open-data model now shapes how Collection 2, ARD, and HLS are released today.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
        <div class="table-wrap mt-4">
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Era</th>
                        <th>Main idea</th>
                        <th>Tutoring hook</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>ERTS / MSS</td>
                        <td>Proved systematic multispectral land imaging from space.</td>
                        <td>Ask why repeated moderate-resolution images changed geography and resource science.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>TM / ETM+</td>
                        <td>Made 30 m multispectral mapping and stronger thermal/visible workflows practical.</td>
                        <td>Compare a natural-color view with a false-color or SWIR view of the same landscape.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>OLI / TIRS</td>
                        <td>Improved radiometry, added modern coastal/cirrus context, and strengthened thermal products.</td>
                        <td>Use Collection 2 Level-2 products as the default teaching path for modern analysis.</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <div class="page-nav">
            <a class="button" href="/briefing/foundations">Previous: foundations</a>
            <a class="button button-primary" href="/briefing/applications">Next: applications</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
